  "details": "To replicate:  Create a cube, set it to track the player's head position and rotation on PostLateUpdate()  (The proscribed update loop for doing things with player tracking data, but any will give the same result)\n\nTest this IN VR specifically as it will not fail in Desktop.  \n\nYou will see the cube will jitter and be delayed while moving about.  If you want a practical example of this failing, it can be seen with the portal cameras in my world, the Whaddatoy Store.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_a3e0ec54-2fc2-49ba-8e32-d0ca9d6bbaa2\n\nTo test there, go up the stairs, turn right, open the Door and you'll see exactly what the problem is as the camera jitters trying to keep up.",
